{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949270/extras/5ba651b36e734142076442b902f5afa2.avif?t=1757621498\" width=1232 height=1232 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vanguard Princess Mobile (PC Port): Early Access Edition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mobile Fighting Sensation\u2014Now on PC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to experience <i><strong>Vanguard Princess</strong></i> like never before! This PC port of the mobile version brings fast-paced 2D combat to your desktop, giving you early access to the action before the full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949270/extras/7297d2abbace544336dbd900fa006b7a.avif?t=1757621498\" width=1242 height=700 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s in Early Access?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Story Mode:</strong> Experience the gripping story and play as all 10 characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Versus Mode:</strong> Battle AI or friends in intense one-on-one fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Online Mode (Limited):</strong> Face off against other players in online matches via Photon servers (limited to 20 concurrent players).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Tutorial Mode:</strong> Learn the fundamentals and mechanics of Vanguard Princess step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Training Mode:</strong> Hone your skills, test combos, and practice with AI dummies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Achievements:</strong> Unlock milestones as you play and track your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Options:</strong> Customize controls, audio, and gameplay settings for your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 